# Artifact Engine

A high-performance artifact storage and retrieval service with GitHub integration for AI-generated content management.

## Features

- **Artifact Storage**: Store and retrieve artifacts with unique IDs
- **Version Control**: Automatic versioning with history tracking
- **GitHub Integration**: Sync artifacts to GitHub repositories
- **Search**: Full-text search across artifact content
- **Rate Limiting**: Built-in protection against abuse
- **Health Monitoring**: Health check endpoints for orchestration

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start development server
npm run dev

# Run tests
npm test
```

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| POST | /artifacts | Create new artifact |
| GET | /artifacts/:id | Retrieve artifact |
| PUT | /artifacts/:id | Update artifact |
| DELETE | /artifacts/:id | Delete artifact |
| GET | /artifacts/:id/versions | Get version history |
| GET | /artifacts/search | Search artifacts |
| GET | /health | Health check |

## Configuration

Set environment variables or use `.env` file:

```
PORT=3002
NODE_ENV=development
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_token_here
GITHUB_OWNER=your_username
GITHUB_REPO=your_repo
```

## Documentation

- [Getting Started](docs/getting-started.md)
- [API Reference](docs/api-reference.md)
- [Architecture](docs/architecture.md)
- [Configuration](docs/configuration.md)

## License

MIT
